# The Operator's Ledger: what stays out of git

# Wesley's voice reference: enough audio to clone his voice. Keep it on this machine only.
voice/

# tool caches and state, rebuilt on demand
**/.hyperframes/
**/.thumbnails/
**/.waveform-cache/
**/.media/
**/node_modules/

# raw voice generations and auditions (regenerable from the VoiceStudio profile and .vo/ scripts)
**/.vo/vox/
**/.vo/try/
**/.vo/backup-george/
**/voice-samples/

# superseded renders: the current render is committed, earlier cuts stay local
**/renders/*-v1-*.mp4
**/renders/*-v2-*.mp4
**/renders/*-v3*.mp4

# earlier cuts kept locally only
**/renders/_old/
